  "comment": "SquirrelMail is a standard web-based webmail package written in PHP. It includes built-in pure PHP support for IMAP and SMTP, and all pages are rendered in pure HTML 4.0 (without the need for JavaScript) for maximum compatibility across browsers. It has very few requirements and is very easy to configure and install. SquirrelMail has all the functionalities you would expect from an email client,",
